#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:5 fa1e3a3c5981464ab958d0d0f4f404da
msgid "Advanced Tuning"
msgstr "高级调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:8 fa320ef1fe0c40d1af1f3eb60620f935
msgid "this page has been superseded and is now ARCHIVED."
msgstr "此页面已被取代，现已归档。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:11 207cff314d864a7795f0cbcb34d34165
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of how to tune various Copter parameters."
msgstr "本文提供了如何调整各种 Copter 参数的概述。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:14 8b220658d82e46659a9ae4d2a2e7a31f
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:16 b8668f088b0f4b838919bb0ff68df236
msgid ""
"The default `PID gains <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PID_controller>`__ are"
" meant for the 3DR IRIS although they work on a wide variety of frames.  "
"Still, to get optimal performance you may need to adjust them which can be "
"done through the *Mission Planner*'s **Config/Tuning \\| Copter Pids** "
"screen.  The screen shot below shows the most important parameters for "
"Roll/Pitch (yellow), Yaw (orange), :ref:`Altitude hold <altholdmode>` "
"(green), :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` (pink) and :ref:`Waypoint navigation "
"<auto-mode>` (blue)."
msgstr ""
"默认的 `PID 增益 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PID_controller>`__ 是为 3DR IRIS "
"设计的，尽管它们在各种机架上都能工作。不过，为了获得最佳性能，您可能需要调整它们，这可以通过 *Mission Planner* 的 "
"**Config/Tuning \\| Copter Pids** 屏幕完成。下面的截图显示了横滚/俯仰（黄色）、偏航（橙色）、:ref:`高度保持 "
"<altholdmode>`（绿色）、:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`（粉色）和 :ref:`航点导航 <auto-"
"mode>`（蓝色）最重要的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:29 1c645d0c092e4a4297fbfeafe5f12202
msgid ""
"The most important parameter to get right is the Rate Roll P (and by default"
" Rate Pitch P is locked to the same value) as discussed :ref:`here "
"<ac_rollpitchtuning>`."
msgstr ""
"最重要的参数是速率横滚 P（默认情况下速率俯仰 P 锁定为相同值），如 :ref:`此处 <ac_rollpitchtuning>` 所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:33 b8ce3f0b4c2441d7b98ae27b2f9be231
msgid ""
"Normally it's best to start by tuning the Rate Roll/Pitch P in Stabilize "
"mode then move onto tuning altitude hold in AltHold mode, then Loiter (which"
" often needs no tuning) and finally the waypoint navigation performance in "
"Auto mode."
msgstr ""
"通常最好从在 Stabilize 模式下调整速率横滚/俯仰 P 开始，然后在 AltHold 模式下调整高度保持，接着是 "
"Loiter（通常无需调整），最后是 Auto 模式下的航点导航性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:40 86b15aa52ce04c28b05833ba74d994d0
msgid ""
"`Dave C's AC2.8.1 tuning guide "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-tuning-guide>`__ has good "
"information for tuning for rate roll and pitch but altitude hold, Loiter and"
" navigation has changed dramatically since AC2.8.1 so those sections are no "
"longer valid."
msgstr ""
"`Dave C 的 AC2.8.1 调参指南 <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-"
"tuning-guide>`__ 对横滚和俯仰速率调参有很好的信息，但高度保持、Loiter 和导航自 AC2.8.1 "
"以来已有重大变化，因此这些部分不再有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:46 7c6c196d6dd64df28796c2a1c971ba14
msgid "Roll/Pitch tuning"
msgstr "横滚/俯仰调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:48 75593b2efd8f4b79b4c01469bdc83651
msgid ""
"The Stabilize Roll/Pitch and Rate Roll/Pitch parameters, highlighted in "
"yellow in the screen shot above control the roll pitch response."
msgstr "上图截图中以黄色突出显示的 Stabilize 横滚/俯仰和速率横滚/俯仰参数控制横滚俯仰响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:51 e77bd33090ff434195b3221a784402dc
msgid ""
"The Rate parameters which convert the desired rotation rate into a motor "
"output are the most important.  The :ref:`Rate Roll and Pitch P tuning page "
"<ac_rollpitchtuning>` has the most information on tuning them."
msgstr ""
"将期望旋转速率转换为电机输出的速率参数最为重要。:ref:`速率横滚和俯仰 P 调参页面 <ac_rollpitchtuning>` "
"包含有关调参的最多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:55 4198eff7bf1340adb0a4a1fb152410b4
msgid ""
"The Stabilize Roll/Pitch P converts the desired angle into a desired "
"rotation rate which is then fed to the Rate controller."
msgstr "Stabilize 横滚/俯仰 P 将期望角度转换为期望旋转速率，然后再传递给速率控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:58 ebe5c2d2d83e407cae8b0d6a01a69011
msgid ""
"A higher value will make the copter more responsive to roll/pitch inputs, a "
"lower value will make it smoother"
msgstr "较高的值会使 Copter 对横滚/俯仰输入响应更灵敏，较低的值会使其更平滑"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:60 927da32f96194a61adf53b9e4221bd33
msgid ""
"If set too high, the copter will oscillate on the roll and/or pitch axis"
msgstr "如果设置太高，Copter 会在横滚和/或俯仰轴上振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:62 6efdc934b2cc497787cb904082470a62
msgid "If set too low the copter will become sluggish to inputs"
msgstr "如果设置太低，Copter 对输入的响应会变得迟钝"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:64 09bb6fbd9390477d9307a087e39c46e9
msgid ""
"More information on tuning the roll and pitch can be found on the "
":ref:`Stabilize mode page's Tuning section <stabilize-mode_tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"关于横滚和俯仰调参的更多信息可以在 :ref:`Stabilize 模式页面的调参部分 <stabilize-mode_tuning>` 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:67 1326bfbbf5ee49459b956a1d7af6bfd5
msgid ""
"An objective view of the overall Roll and Pitch performance can be seen by "
"graphing the :ref:`dataflash log's <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-"
"logs-in-mission-planner>` ATT message's Roll-In vs Roll and Pitch-In vs "
"Pitch. The \"Roll\" (i.e. actual roll) should closely follow the \"Roll-In\""
" while in Stabilize or AltHold modes. Pitch should similarly closely follow "
"Pitch-In."
msgstr ""
"通过绘制 :ref:`dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-"
"mission-planner>` 的 ATT 消息中的 Roll-In 与 Roll 以及 Pitch-In 与 Pitch "
"的对比图，可以客观地查看整体横滚和俯仰性能。在 Stabilize 或 AltHold 模式下，\"Roll\"（即实际横滚）应该紧随\"Roll-"
"In\"。俯仰同样应该紧随 Pitch-In。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:73 3944f7d55122488aa9c20eb16d1a95cd
msgid ""
"Alternatively you may wish to try tuning both the rate and stabilize (i.e. "
"angular) parameters using the :ref:`AutoTune feature <autotune>`."
msgstr "或者，您可能希望尝试使用 :ref:`AutoTune 功能 <autotune>` 同时调整速率和稳定化（即角度）参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:77 8565818f9c814aee9724002d3b4a0265
msgid "Yaw tuning"
msgstr "偏航调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:79 1106de69b7f14ad8a64ba4739014d2a4
msgid ""
"The Stabilize Yaw and Rate Yaw parameters, highlighted in orange in the "
"screen shot above control the yaw response. It's rare that the yaw requires "
"much tuning."
msgstr "上图截图中以橙色突出显示的 Stabilize 偏航和速率偏航参数控制偏航响应。偏航很少需要大量调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:83 ef047164ae544f1e8d731c87bc2daf19
msgid ""
"Similar to roll and pitch if either Stabilize Yaw P or Rate Yaw P is too "
"high the copter's heading will oscillate. If they are too low the copter may"
" be unable to maintain its heading."
msgstr ""
"与横滚和俯仰类似，如果 Stabilize 偏航 P 或速率偏航 P 过高，Copter 的航向将会振荡。如果过低，Copter 可能无法保持航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:87 bf0b47153a904811b2434224f3d9af3b
msgid ""
"As mentioned on the :ref:`Stabilize mode's tuning section <stabilize-"
"mode_tuning>`, the :ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` parameter controls how "
"quickly copter rotates based on a pilot’s yaw input.  The default of 4.5 "
"commands a 200 deg/sec rate of rotation when the yaw stick is held fully "
"left or right.  Higher values will make it rotate more quickly."
msgstr ""
"如 :ref:`Stabilize 模式调参部分 <stabilize-mode_tuning>` "
"所述，:ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` 参数控制 Copter 根据飞手偏航输入旋转的速度。默认值 4.5 "
"在偏航摇杆完全向左或向右时命令 200 deg/s 的旋转速率。较高的值会使其旋转更快。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:94 4caf0363455c4d0aa335d0cec0fdf68d
msgid "Altitude Tuning"
msgstr "高度调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:96 751072edc1a94a78bec43eb51c8ae5d6
msgid ""
"The Altitude hold related tuning parameters are highlighted in green in the "
"screen shot above."
msgstr "与高度保持相关的调参参数在上图截图中以绿色突出显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:99 cae7cd132cea437994cf689949a858d7
msgid ""
"The Altitude Hold P is used to convert the altitude error (the difference "
"between the desired altitude and the actual altitude) to a desired climb or "
"descent rate.  A higher rate will make it more aggressively attempt to "
"maintain its altitude but if set too high leads to a jerky throttle "
"response."
msgstr ""
"高度保持 P "
"用于将高度误差（期望高度与实际高度之间的差值）转换为期望的爬升或下降速率。较高的速率会使其更积极地尝试保持高度，但如果设置太高会导致油门响应抖动。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:105 1cf977adbf194c578dbf21ab6edd979c
msgid ""
"The Throttle Rate (which normally requires no tuning) converts the desired "
"climb or descent rate into a desired acceleration up or down."
msgstr "油门速率（通常不需要调整）将期望的爬升或下降速率转换为期望的向上或向下加速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:108 6be5c6a32dc242edbd44db5b186dd011
msgid ""
"The Throttle Accel PID gains convert the acceleration error (i.e the "
"difference between the desired acceleration and the actual acceleration) "
"into a motor output.  The 1:2 ratio of P to I (i.e. I is twice the size of "
"P) should be maintained if you modify these parameters.  These values should"
" never be increased but for very powerful copters you may get better "
"response by reducing both by 50% (i.e P to 0.5, I to 1.0)."
msgstr ""
"油门加速度 PID 增益将加速度误差（即期望加速度与实际加速度之间的差值）转换为电机输出。如果您修改这些参数，应保持 P 与 I 的 1:2 比例（即 "
"I 是 P 的两倍）。这些值永远不应增加，但对于非常强劲的 Copter，您可以通过将两者都减少 50%（即 P 降至 0.5，I 降至 "
"1.0）来获得更好的响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:115 c7386fd83d8541638724c9dc99b6e216
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Altitude Hold flight mode page <altholdmode>` for more "
"information."
msgstr "更多信息请参见 :ref:`高度保持飞行模式页面 <altholdmode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:118 a8fa376d9cad4fb4ab39c86e99c212d1
msgid "Loiter Tuning"
msgstr "Loiter 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:120 8ce4637e59344bed80d9692494932db1
msgid ""
"Generally if Roll and Pitch are tuned correctly,  the :ref:`GPS <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs_gps_glitches>` and :ref:`compass <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>` are set-up and "
"performing well and :ref:`vibration levels <common-diagnosing-problems-"
"using-logs_vibrations>` are acceptable, Loiter does not require much tuning "
"but please see the :ref:`Loiter Mode <loiter-mode_tuning>` page for more "
"details on tunable parameters including the horizontal speed."
msgstr ""
"通常，如果横滚和俯仰调参正确，:ref:`GPS <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_gps_glitches>` 和 :ref:`罗盘 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_compass_interference>` 设置良好并表现正常，且 :ref:`震动水平 <common-diagnosing-"
"problems-using-logs_vibrations>` 可接受，Loiter 不需要大量调参，但请查看 :ref:`Loiter 模式 "
"<loiter-mode_tuning>` 页面了解可调参数（包括水平速度）的更多详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:129 4f5afda58c944e1f8f507ce19ed989f5
msgid "In-flight tuning"
msgstr "飞行中调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:131 64e70326c55347e6878091a8c0165509
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Transmitter based tuning<common-transmitter-tuning>` page for "
"details."
msgstr "详情请参见 :ref:`基于遥控器的调参<common-transmitter-tuning>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:134 91a716baf9c64700910f52b6b96dc033
msgid "Filter tuning"
msgstr "滤波器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:136 5389898fb42045cb94b49d641d1d42bc
msgid ""
"Copters are often affected by vibration and tuning the various software "
"filters available is critical to achieving an overall tune. A guide on "
"tuning the various notch filters available can be found on the :ref:`Notch "
"Filtering wiki page <common-imu-notch-filtering>`."
msgstr ""
"Copter 通常受到震动影响，调整各种可用的软件滤波器对于实现整体调参至关重要。有关调整各种可用陷波滤波器的指南可以在 :ref:`陷波滤波器 "
"wiki 页面 <common-imu-notch-filtering>` 上找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:140 e10a862f369d4dd1ab5fb172b2b0645d
msgid "Video introduction to PIDs"
msgstr "PID 视频介绍"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:142 2cb58fa444cf4cdc87a167944adc1a18
msgid ""
"PIDs (Proportional - Integral - Derivative) are the method used by our "
"firmware to continuously stabilize the vehicle"
msgstr "PID（比例-积分-微分）是我们的固件用于持续稳定飞行器的方法"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:145 48b776b3c8c3402bae6ac7e94a1e6737
msgid ""
"Proportional = Immediate Correction: The further off you are the bigger the "
"correction you make."
msgstr "比例 = 即时校正：偏差越大，校正量越大。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:147 5f6374ba167d42a392f856711687966c
msgid ""
"Integral = Over time or steady state correction: If we are failing to make "
"progress add additional correction."
msgstr "积分 = 随时间或稳态校正：如果未能取得进展，则增加额外校正。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning.rst:149 cb6b4c33e411407e87f6829945372f58
msgid ""
"Derivative = Take it Easy correction: Is the correction going to fast? if it"
" is slow it down (dampen) it a bit to avoid overshoot."
msgstr "微分 = 缓和校正：校正速度太快了吗？如果是，则稍微减慢（阻尼）以避免过冲。"
